        "original_id": "a9939c23-8a73-5705-8b36-fa2008029743",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Laura Warholic, Darconville’s Cat\n- People: Alexander Theroux, Anthony Burgess, Larry McCaffery\n- Topics: American novelists, poets\n\nFacts:\n- Alexander Theroux was born in 1939 and is an American novelist and poet.\n- Alexander Theroux’s 1981 novel Darconville’s Cat is perhaps his best known novel.\n- Anthony Burgess selected Darconville’s Cat for Ninety-Nine Novels: The Best in English since 1939 – A Personal Choice in 1984.\n- Larry McCaffery also included Darconville’s Cat in 20th Century’s Greatest Hits.\n- Alexander Theroux wrote Laura Warholic; or, The Sexual Intellectual, a novel published in 2007.",
